ui
	^ 'Spec UI (legacy):
- HSKSpec: main ComposablePresenterWithModel. initializeWidgets creates the exercises notebook and opens Pinyin Reminder and Pinyin Attack pages; subMenu builds a menu; start and stop delegate to the attack; modelChanged forwards the model to every page; defaultSpec is one column with exercises. The menu instance variable is never assigned.
- HSKPinyinReminder: ComposablePresenterWithModel. Widgets: AthensStaticPresenter word (100x100), meanings text, pinyin text input (autoAccept), Accept, Hint, Give up and Inspect buttons, status text, and todo/done ComponentListPresenters of HSKCharacterProfile. acceptEntry validates a non-empty pinyin, calls exercise current assertWith:, sets result #right or #wrong, shows the expected pinyin and advances; hintNeeded shows the current hint; giveUp shows the pinyin, submits a give up and advances; inspectCurrentChar inspects the current exercise; privateNext advances and refreshes lists; loadData clears the input and refreshes meanings and lists; modelChanged creates SRSPhoneticExercise goal: model; startup calls modelChanged. Layout methods box, grid, bodyGrid and table use legacy Spec layouts; defaultSpec answers box.
- HSKPinyinAttack: ComposablePresenterWithModel with a text entry and an AthensAnimatedPresenter viewport (900x500). A Timeline drives ticks; drawOn: clears the canvas and draws the character 好 at 20@tick with PingFang TC 30; start forks a loop while animating, ticking and waiting 50 ms; stop terminates the process; updateModelTo: stores the tick and refreshes.
- HSKCharacterProfile: presenter with character, level and result labels; model: an SRSKnownContent, skill: and result:; drawCharacterOn:box: draws through HSKDrawableContent with PingFang TC 5 (the Athens label code is commented out).
- HSKDrawableContent: content and font; drawOn:at:font: translates the canvas and draws content asHSKString traditionalString.

Toplo desktop shell (HSKDesktopShell):
- Structure: ToPane root (id-less); buildToolbar (usersBar id #usersBar, New user button id #newUserButton, Style button id #styleButton, status label id #status) and buildBody (menuPane id #menu + viewport id #viewport shown with showInViewport:). Old buildHeader and the tab-pane exercise path are removed dead code.
- Menu: HSKDesktopShell class>>menuEntries returns 4 entries of the form {id. title. tooltip. selector}: Knowledge / Pinyin Reminder (tooltip from HSKReminderPage explanation) / Pinyin Quiz (tooltip from HSKQuizPage explanation) / Game; buildMenu creates one titled and tooltipped ToButton per entry (id, tooltipText:) whose action performs the selector.
- Exercise pages: showReminderPage/showQuizPage announce to create a user first when no user is selected, otherwise build the page (HSKReminderPage/HSKQuizPage on: app) and show its view.
- HSKExerciseView: abstract superclass of the exercise views (ToPane with slots page and factory). initialize does vertical + matchParent; accessors page/factory; initializeWidgets = removeChildren + addTitleAndTooltip: a title label (factory styling, fontSize 20) from page title as first child plus self tooltipText: page explanation.
- HSKReminderView/HSKQuizView: subclasses with page:factory: constructors; initializeWidgets starts with super initializeWidgets and adds its widgets (reminder: word #word big label, meanings #meanings, input #input with placeholder enter the pinyin, result #result, Accept/Hint/Give up buttons; quiz: target #target big label, options pane #options, result #result, optionButtonFor:result:redrawing:). Text always through the factory (styledText:).
- HSKKnowledgeView: ToPane id #tiles; refresh clears children and adds one tile per overview entry (nothing when the app has no user); showKnowledgePage refreshes it and shows it in the viewport.
- HSKGameView: placeholder view (buildPlaceholder shows a big label with 戲 - game coming in the next initiative, id #gamePlaceholder); shown by showGamePage.
- app: wires the app announcer (refreshUsers + knowledgeView refresh on HSKUserAdded/HSKUserSelected, knowledgeView refresh on HSKStyleChanged) and subscribeToCurrentUser for user-level notifications; knowledgeSpellingOf: and statusText expose state for tests. Class side ensureNSimSunAvailable registers simsun.ttc and sets it as defaultFace; on: calls it. openOn: opens a Bee themed BlSpace 800x600.'